        <item>
            <title>0.57</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 13:17:13 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202610081314</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.57</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Idle orders show clear symbols and say what they do; a teammate is at work, not waiting for you</li>
<li>Office names and owner stamps stay inside their own room</li>
<li>Typing a share name no longer restarts sharing or rebuilds the station</li>
<li>Stations reach each other on a shared network, and say why when they cannot</li>
<li>The climb runs at the rocket's own pace, a rocket going up keeps its pad, and liftoff leaves soot</li>
<li>With a board, only its column clears work, and a rocket standing by holds nothing</li>
<li>A gate rebuilt with the floor takes its scan rings and belt crates with it</li>
<li>Hallway no office needs any more is taken up again, from its far end inward</li>
<li>A release that can't be notarised stops with Apple's reason instead of going out unnotarised</li>
<li>The roadmap drops the release that went out and keeps the missing notarisation</li>
<li>Idle is what the empty board leaves a body to, and nothing waits on a body any more</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
